    "fcfb13b33c": {
      "title": "R Madhavan lauds Soori’s ‘Mandaadi’ after OTT release; calls it a ‘Diamond from Tamil Cinema’",
      "link": "https://news.google.?oc=5",
      "source": "The Times of India",
      "caption": "Actor R. Madhavan took to social media to heap praise on Soori's latest Tamil film, hailing it as a true diamond from Tamil cinema following its digital release. Madhavan appreciated the raw storytelling, emotional depth, and standout performances, expressing his admiration for the realistic filmmaking. He particularly commended Soori for delivering yet another compelling, rooted performance that resonates deeply with audiences. The film, which showcases intense rural drama, has been garnering widespread appreciation from film enthusiasts and industry peers alike since premiering on streaming platforms. This high praise from a seasoned actor like Madhavan has further amplified positive word-of-mouth for the project among cinephiles. \n\n#Soori #RMadhavan #Kollywood #TamilCinema #OTTRelease #TamilMovies",
