      "source": "Kerala TV",
      "caption": "Dulquer Salmaan’s upcoming Telugu film *Aakasamlo Oka Tara* is gearing up for its promotional rollout, with the official teaser scheduled to drop on October 17 at 11 AM. Directed by Pavan Sadineni, the film marks another exciting straight Telugu project for the Malayalam star following his acclaimed performances in *Mahanati*, *Sita Ramam*, and *Lucky Baskhar*. The project is bankrolled by Sandeep Gunnam and Ramya Gunnam under Light Box Media in association with Geetha Arts. Fans have eagerly awaited updates since the film's title concept poster was unveiled earlier on the actor's birthday. The makers have announced that the feature is slated for a worldwide theatrical release on November 20. ✨\n\n#AakasamloOkaTara #DulquerSalmaan #PavanSadineni #GeethaArts #Tollywood #TeluguCinema #DQSalmaan",
