    "e8961456f2": {
      "title": "Jr NTR’s 'Dragon' shoot resumes after shoulder surgery; Prashanth Neel films other sequences during recov",
      "link": "https://news.google.?oc=5",
      "source": "The Times of India",
      "caption": "Jr NTR has resumed shooting for his highly anticipated project tentatively titled Dragon, directed by Prashanth Neel. The actor had recently taken a short break from production to undergo treatment and recover from a minor shoulder sprain sustained during gym workouts. During his recovery period, Prashanth Neel continued filming key sequences involving other cast members in Ramoji Film City to keep the schedule on track. With NTR now fully recovered, high-octane action blocks and crucial dramatic scenes are slated to be filmed in the coming schedules. Produced by Mythri Movie Makers and NTR Arts, the mega-budget pan-Indian spectacle is slated to hit theatres on January 9, 2026. Fans are eagerly looking forward to this powerhouse collaboration between the RRR star and the KGF director.\n\n#JrNTR #PrashanthNeel #NTR31 #Dragon #NTRNeel #Tollywood #TeluguCinema",
      "image": "graphics/e8961456f2.jpg",
      "status": "posted",
