      "source": "The Times of India",
      "caption": "The makers of the upcoming Tamil thriller film Thiduk have officially released its engaging teaser to build anticipation among fans. Directed by Praveen, the movie features a talented cast and promises to deliver a gripping cinematic experience filled with suspense and mystery. The fast-paced teaser offers a glimpse into the dark and intriguing world crafted by the director, hinting at unexpected twists and turns. Audiences are praising the atmospheric background score and slick cinematography that elevate the overall tension in the footage. Further details regarding the official theatrical release date and complete cast lineup are expected to be announced by the production team soon.\n\n#Thiduk #ThidukTeaser #TamilCinema #Kollywood #TamilMovies #KollywoodUpdates",
